<title>USA: Cinemark USA Inc Q2 net off after year ago gain.</title>
<headline>Cinemark USA Inc Q2 net off after year ago gain.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CINEMARK USA, INC.</p>
<p>				   FINANCIAL SUMMARY</p>
<p>	 For the Fiscal Second Quarter and Six Months</p>
<p>		Ended June 30, 1997 and June 30, 1996</p>
<p>				 (In Thousands)</p>
<p>			    2nd Qtr   2nd Qtr    Six Mos    Six Mos</p>
<p>			     Ended	Ended     Ended	Ended</p>
<p>			    Jun 30,   Jun 30,    Jun 30,    Jun 30,</p>
<p>				 1997	1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p> Total Revenues     $ 102,791   $84,578  $ 205,773  $ 158,304</p>
<p> Operating Income (1)  12,262     8,444     28,828     17,953</p>
<p> EBITDA (2)		17,884    13,409     40,337     27,950</p>
<p> Net Income		3,020  4,312 (a)  8,134 (b)  6,829 (a)</p>
<p>(1) Total revenues less cost of operations, depreciation and amortization and general and administrative expenses.</p>
<p>(2) Represents operating income plus non-cash items included in operating income.</p>
<p>(a) Includes a gain of $2.0 million, after tax, primarily related to a litigation settlement.</p>
<p>(b) Includes extraordinary loss of $335,000, net of related tax benefit, resulting from the early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
